	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_farm_3_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>麦秸缓冲让底层番茄毫无挤压磕伤，收购商验货后当场多加了赏钱。<<else>>垫入底层的干麦秸软硬适中，满筐红番茄没有一处挤压磕痕。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">铺垫麦秸的周到做法保住了全部鲜果。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<link [[听亚历克斯讲选果门道 (0:04)|MP Job Farm Upgrade]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">听亚历克斯讲选果门道 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	干麦秸扎了一下手腕，铺得有些厚薄不均。<span class="red">你拍平底层麦秸准备重新码果。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[铺厚底层麦秸重码 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Farm 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回农场打谷场定神 (0:03)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Partner Clock 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "dusk" or Time.dayState is "night">>钟表铺晚间盘点零件时，<<else>>钟表铺后间整理工具的空档里，<</if>>老学徒端出一盘混杂在一起的怀表蓝钢螺丝，请你帮忙用分厘卡尺按螺距归入玻璃小瓶。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回钟表铺前厅 (0:03)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_clock_3 is 1>>
混杂的怀表蓝钢螺丝今日已按螺距悉数归入玻璃瓶，柜面井然有序。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-job-partner-clock-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用卡尺量准螺距归瓶 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-clock-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_clock_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_clock_3")>><<money 1520>>百余枚细小螺丝分门别类装入小瓶，老学徒欣喜地将塞拉发的盘点津贴分给你。<<else>>百余枚细小钟表螺丝按规格归入玻璃小瓶，桌面瞬间清爽有序。<</if>><span class="green">你凭精密测量将全部蓝钢螺丝归档完毕。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好卡尺继续修表 (0:04)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	一枚极细的螺丝从镊子尖弹落，掉在绒布垫上。<span class="red">你拿吸铁石找回螺丝准备再量。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦亮卡尺刻度再量 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Clock 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回钟表铺前厅歇息 (0:03)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "借放大镜比对螺帽槽分拣 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-clock-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_clock_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_clock_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>你一眼便能辨出三种制式螺帽，不到一刻钟便帮老学徒理清了整盘零件。<<else>>你凭目测便分清了三种制式螺帽，转眼帮老学徒理清了整盘零件。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">敏锐眼力让你飞快完成了零件分拣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[请塞拉过目分拣螺钉 (0:04)|MP Job Clock Upgrade]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">请塞拉过目分拣螺钉 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	灯光在金属盘上反光刺眼，看得你眼角微酸。<span class="red">你调暗台灯角度准备重新比对。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫高放大镜重新比对 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Clock 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回钟表铺前厅定神 (0:03)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Partner Laundry 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>孤儿院洗衣房夜里熨烫衣物时，<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "rain">>孤儿院洗衣房雨天熨烫衣物时，<<else>>孤儿院洗衣房午后叠衣的时段里，<</if>>同班帮工抱来一摞神殿送洗的亚麻祭坛巾，请你帮忙注入薰衣草花露并折出整齐折痕。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回洗衣房工位 (0:03)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_laundry_3 is 1>>
神殿送洗的亚麻祭坛巾今日已全部熨平折妥，散发着淡雅薰衣草香。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-job-partner-laundry-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "喷花露趁热压出折痕 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-laundry-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_laundry_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_laundry_3")>><<money 1520>>祭坛巾折得棱角分明、清香扑鼻，同班帮工与你分享了神殿执事给的赏钱。<<else>>亚麻祭坛巾折得棱角分明，熏衣草的清香在指尖萦绕不散。<</if>><span class="green">你熨折的祭坛巾连神殿执事都挑不出瑕疵。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放回熨斗继续整理 (0:04)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜熨斗底面余温略高，烫得手背一缩。<span class="red">你把熨斗架回铁座晾凉少许。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[调准熨斗温度再压 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Laundry 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回洗衣房工位歇息 (0:03)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用折衣板将祭坛巾对齐码平 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-laundry-3">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_laundry_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_laundry_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>整摞祭坛巾尺寸分毫不差，装入樟木箱时严丝合缝，赢来一份额外工钱。<<else>>整摞祭坛巾尺寸对齐得分毫不差，装入樟木箱时严丝合缝。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">巧用折衣板让整箱祭坛巾齐整如一。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[跟罗宾核对熨烫折痕 (0:04)|MP Job Laundry Upgrade]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">跟罗宾核对熨烫折痕 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	亚麻布面顺滑，最上面两条稍微滑歪了半寸。<span class="red">你用棉绳先系住底座准备重码。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压紧折衣板重新码平 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Laundry 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回洗衣房工位定神 (0:03)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Partner Bakery 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "morning" or Time.dayState is "day">>烘焙坊早市刚出炉的甜点台前，<<else>>烘焙坊准备下午茶点心的操作台旁，<</if>>同班烘焙工正在给一批杏仁牛角包刷蛋液，请你搭手撒上烤香的杏仁薄片。

