	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[端起烤盘继续看火 (0:04)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	烤盘边缘尚带余温，轻触时烫了一下小指。<span class="red">你戴好隔热手套准备继续撒片。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[抓匀杏仁薄片重撒 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Bakery 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回烘焙坊案台歇息 (0:03)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
