<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_bakery_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_bakery_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>每一只牛角包都烤出了漂亮的琥珀色光泽，面包师傅乐呵呵地给你加发了老字号信物铜牌。<<else>>每一只牛角包都烤出了漂亮的琥珀色光泽，表皮酥脆掉渣。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">均匀细腻的蛋液让整炉点心色泽完美。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[请师傅品鉴杏仁酥皮 (0:04)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	软毛刷蘸多了蛋液，滴在烤盘纸上。<span class="red">你刮去多余蛋液擦净烤盘纸。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[蘸匀蛋液重新刷面 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Bakery 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回烘焙坊案台定神 (0:03)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

