	<br>
	<<link [[先退回裁缝铺前厅歇息 (0:03)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用丝绒裹住铅链暗缝内衬 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-tailor-3">>
