	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_tailor_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>包上丝绒的配重链走动时毫无摩擦声响，莫奈看后当场多批了一笔手工奖。<<else>>包上丝绒条的配重链服帖隐蔽，走动时听不见半点金属摩擦声。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">包裹丝绒的巧思让晚礼服尽显高定水准。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
